# 04 — API Contract Remediation (V2 Control Plane)

**Status:** ARCHITECTURE REMEDIATION (non-live, no code change)
**Date:** 2026-05-24
**Author:** Claude Code (planner mode, read-only)
**Scope:** Resolves the blocker `API_CONTRACT_INCOMPLETE` identified by Codex adversarial review of the V2 architecture. Defines every public/internal HTTP+WS endpoint, its request/response/error schemas, idempotency posture, RBAC matrix, and the contract-schema deltas required vs. the prior draft.
**Read-only inputs:**
- `claude_worklog/agent_supervisor/tasks/002_codex_adversarial_architecture_review.json`
- `claude_worklog/agent_supervisor/tasks/004_fix_api_contract_architecture.json`
- `claude_worklog/v2_architecture_remediation/02_RISK_GATEWAY_REMEDIATION.md` (assumed sibling)
