## 0. Remediation Summary (vs. prior draft)

| # | Defect found by Codex | Resolution in this doc |
|---|------------------------|-------------------------|
| C1 | Endpoints listed only as "GET /signals" with no schema | Full request/response JSON Schemas inline (§3–§5) |
| C2 | No idempotency strategy for control-plane writes | Mandatory `Idempotency-Key` header for every POST/PATCH/DELETE that mutates state, with replay window + storage model (§2.6) |
| C3 | RBAC inferred from path only | Explicit RBAC matrix per endpoint with role + scope + approval requirement (§2.5, §3–§5) |
| C4 | No error envelope; mix of 4xx/5xx without typed codes | Single `ErrorEnvelope` with `error.code` taxonomy (§2.4) |
| C5 | Dangerous mutations (enable live, key rotation) lacked dual-control / approval handshake | Two-phase `propose → approve` contract with HMAC-bound proposal IDs (§2.7) |
| C6 | WebSocket streams were undefined | WS channel registry with envelope, heartbeat, replay cursor (§6) |
| C7 | No versioning / deprecation contract | `/v1` URL prefix + `X-API-Version` + `Sunset` header policy (§2.2) |
| C8 | No pagination/filter standard | Cursor-based pagination contract (§2.3) |
| C9 | Trainer/Ollama/Codex/Claude admin endpoints missing entirely | Added §5 (Admin AI surfaces) |
| C10 | No content-type / negotiation rules | Strict `application/json; charset=utf-8`, UTF-8, ISO-8601 UTC, monotonic ints (§2.1) |

