## 4. Endpoint Detail — Control & Admin Surfaces

### 4.1 Executions (paper/replay only)

| # | Method | Path | RBAC | Idempotent | Purpose |
|---|--------|------|------|------------|---------|
| 4.1.1 | GET    | /executions                                  | viewer+   | n/a | List |
| 4.1.2 | GET    | /executions/{id}                             | viewer+   | n/a | Detail |
| 4.1.3 | POST   | /executions/paper                            | operator+ | yes | Submit paper execution (validated through risk) |
| 4.1.4 | POST   | /executions/paper/{id}/cancel                | operator+ | yes | Cancel paper |
| 4.1.5 | GET    | /executions/stats                            | viewer+   | n/a | Latency, slippage, fill ratio |
| 4.1.6 | GET    | /executions/export                           | viewer+   | n/a | JSONL |

**4.1.3 Request**
```json
{
  "signal_id":"01J...",
  "symbol":"BTCUSDT","side":"buy|sell","qty":"0.001",
  "order_type":"market|limit","price":"60123.45|null","tif":"IOC|GTC",
  "mode":"paper",                       // server rejects "live" unless live gate passed
  "reason":"operator backtest",
  "risk_overrides":null
}
```
Server flow: validate → risk gateway `/api/v1/risk/decide` (internal) → if allow, write paper fill via paper engine. Returns `201` with `execution_id` and `audit_id`.
**Errors:** `422 E_RISK_BLOCKED` (with `details.risk_reason`), `423 E_STATE_KILL_SWITCH`, `451 E_RISK_LIVE_BLOCKED`.

