**4.3.2 Request (internal)**
```json
{
  "proposal_id":"01J...","symbol":"BTCUSDT","side":"buy","qty":"0.01",
  "price":"60100","leverage":"1","margin_mode":"ISOLATED",
  "context":{"signal_id":"...","strategy_id":"...","mode":"paper",
             "feature_freshness_sec":{"funding":12,"mark":1},
             "open_exposure_usd":"0","equity_usd":"12345"}
}
```
**Response 200**
```json
{ "decision":"allow|block|defer",
  "reason_code":"R_OK|R_STALE_FEATURES|R_MAX_LEVERAGE|R_DAILY_LOSS|R_KILL_SWITCH|...",
  "reason_human":"...","applied_thresholds":{...},
  "audit_id":"01J...","ttl_sec":5 }
```
Orchestrator MUST NOT execute if `decision != "allow"`; doing so is contract violation logged as `E_STATE_RISK_BYPASS`.

