## 6. WebSocket Channel Registry

Single endpoint: `/ws/v1` upgraded with auth bearer in `Sec-WebSocket-Protocol` (`bearer.<jwt>`). Clients subscribe via control frame; server pushes data frames.

### 6.1 Envelope
```json
{
  "type":"event|ack|error|heartbeat",
  "channel":"<channel>",
  "seq": 12345,                  // monotonic per channel per connection
  "ts":"2026-05-24T12:00:00Z",
  "data": {...},
  "evidence":{"audit_id":"01J...|null"}
}
```
Heartbeat every 15s; missing 2 → server closes with `1011 E_RUNTIME_HEARTBEAT`.

### 6.2 Channels

| Channel | Producer area | Replay cursor | RBAC |
|---------|----------------|---------------|------|
| `mission.alerts`              | §3.2  | last 1000     | viewer+ |
| `monitor.predictions`         | §3.3  | last 5000     | viewer+ |
| `monitor.feature_freshness`   | §3.3  | last 1000     | viewer+ |
| `signals.stream`              | §3.7  | last 5000     | viewer+ |
| `trainer.predictions`         | §3.8  | last 5000     | viewer+ |
| `executions.stream`           | §4.1  | last 1000     | viewer+ |
| `positions.updates`           | §4.2  | snapshot      | viewer+ |
| `risk.decisions`              | §4.3  | last 1000     | viewer+ |
| `trainer.runtime_events`      | §4.6  | last 500      | viewer+ |
| `orchestrator.events`         | §4.7  | last 1000     | viewer+ |
| `paper.events`                | §4.9  | last 1000     | viewer+ |
| `replay.progress`             | §4.10 | per-session   | viewer+ |
| `audit.tail`                  | §4.11 | last 500      | auditor+ |
| `health.components`           | §4.12 | snapshot      | viewer+ |
| `claude.task_progress`        | §5.1  | per-task      | viewer+ |
| `ollama.task_progress`        | §5.2  | per-task      | viewer+ |
| `codex.review_progress`       | §5.3  | per-review    | viewer+ |
| `build.events`                | §5.4  | last 200      | viewer+ |
| `system.kill_switch`          | §4.3  | latest        | viewer+ |
| `system.live_readiness`       | §4.13 | latest        | viewer+ |

Subscribe frame:
```json
{ "op":"subscribe","channel":"signals.stream","since_seq": 12340 }
```
Reject if RBAC insufficient → `{"type":"error","code":"E_RBAC_DENIED"}` and channel removed.

