## 7. Contract Schema Deltas (vs. prior draft)

| Object | Prior draft | Required delta |
|--------|-------------|----------------|
| `Signal` | omitted `calibrated_confidence`, `risk_decision`, `evidence` | Add all three; `evidence` is mandatory non-empty |
| `Execution` | numeric `qty` as float | String decimal; reject float |
| `RiskDecision` | no `ttl_sec`, no `applied_thresholds` | Add both; orchestrator must re-ask after TTL |
| `ConfigVersion` | mutable `id` | Make immutable; activation is a separate verb |
| `Strategy` | `mode:"live"` allowed at create | Force `mode:"paper"`; live transition only via §4.13 |
| `Proposal` | single-phase | Two-phase with HMAC + approver identity |
| `MonitorScript` | no `evidence.raw_source` | Mandatory raw-source pointer (CLAUDE.md evidence rule) |
| `OllamaOutput` | `verified` boolean | Replace with `verified_against` (raw-evidence ref); endpoint blocks without it |
| `AuditRow` | no hash chain | Add `prev_hash`, `row_hash`; expose `/audit/verify` |
| `Error` | mixed shapes | Single `ErrorEnvelope` (§2.4) |
| `Pagination` | offset-based | Cursor-based (§2.3) |
| `Headers` | no `Idempotency-Key`, `If-Match`, `X-Request-ID`, `X-API-Version` | All four standardized |

