### 4.6 Error payload schema (per code, examples)
| `code` | HTTP | `details` shape |
|---|---|---|
| `ERR_AUTH_INVALID_TOKEN` | 401 | `{}` |
| `ERR_AUTH_MFA_REQUIRED` | 401 | `{ "challenge_id":"string" }` |
| `ERR_RBAC_SCOPE_DENIED` | 403 | `{ "required_scopes":["..."], "actor_scopes":["..."] }` |
| `ERR_VALIDATION_FIELD` | 422 | `{ "field":"path.to.field", "constraint":"string", "got":"any" }` |
| `ERR_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REQUIRED` | 400 | `{}` |
| `ERR_IDEMPOTENCY_BODY_MISMATCH` | 409 | `{ "key":"uuid" }` |
| `ERR_CONCURRENCY_ETAG_STALE` | 412 | `{ "expected":"etag","actual":"etag" }` |
| `ERR_STATE_LIVE_BLOCKED` | 503 | `{ "unblock_steps":["..."] }` |
| `ERR_RISK_POLICY_BLOCK` | 409 | `{ "policy_version":"...", "reasons":["..."] }` |
| `ERR_LEGACY_ADAPTER_TIMEOUT` | 504 | `{ "adapter":"trainer\|exchange_mirror","elapsed_ms":1234 }` |
| `ERR_TRAINER_STALE` | 409 | `{ "last_fresh_at":"RFC3339","threshold_s":600 }` |
| `ERR_RATELIMIT_EXCEEDED` | 429 | `{ "retry_after_s":12 }` |
| `ERR_INTEGRITY_EVIDENCE_MISSING` | 409 | `{ "claim_id":"...", "missing":["..."] }` |
| `ERR_INTERNAL_UNEXPECTED` | 500 | `{ "incident_id":"uuid" }` |

Delta: `ERR_INTEGRITY_EVIDENCE_MISSING` is new — surfaces the Evidence Integrity Rule into the API so the GUI can refuse to display unverified claims as if they were verified.

