## 2. Contract Schemas (Per-Endpoint Details)

> Notation: `JSONSchema-ish`. Optional fields marked `?`. Enums fully enumerated. All money fields are decimal strings to avoid float drift.

### 2.1 `POST /v1/auth/login`
**Roles:** public · **Bucket:** `auth` · **Idempotent:** no
**Request:**
```json
{
  "username": "string (3..64)",
  "password": "string (8..256)",
  "mfa_code?": "string (6..8 digits)"
}
```
**Response 200:**
```json
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "access_token": "jwt",
    "refresh_token": "jwt",
    "expires_in": 900,
    "principal": {
      "id": "ulid",
      "username": "string",
      "roles": ["viewer", "operator"],
      "mfa_enrolled": true
    }
  }
}
```
**Errors:** `401 AUTH_INVALID_CREDENTIALS`, `401 AUTH_MFA_REQUIRED`, `423 AUTH_LOCKED`, `429 RL_AUTH`.

### 2.2 `POST /v1/approvals/issue`
**Roles:** approver-class · **Idempotent:** yes
**Request:**
```json
{
  "target_route": "/v1/risk/config",
  "target_method": "PATCH",
  "target_body_sha256": "hex(64)",
  "ttl_seconds": 600,
  "reason": "string (10..500)"
}
```
**Response 200:**
```json
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "token_id": "ulid",
    "token": "jws-compact",
    "expires_at": "2026-05-24T12:10:00Z",
    "issued_by": "principal_id",
    "binding": {
      "route": "/v1/risk/config",
      "method": "PATCH",
      "body_sha256": "hex",
      "single_use": true
    }
  }
}
```
**Errors:** `403 AUTH_ROLE_INSUFFICIENT`, `412 APPROVAL_SELF_APPROVAL_FORBIDDEN`, `422 VAL_BODY_HASH_INVALID`.

### 2.3 `GET /v1/system/live-blockade`
**Response 200:**
```json
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "live_trading_enabled": false,
    "mode": "paper",
    "blockade_reasons": ["phase_2_active", "live_gatekeeper_not_armed"],
    "evidence": {
      "config_pointer": "v2/config/system.yaml#live_trading_enabled",
      "audit_ledger_id": "01HXY..."
    },
    "last_changed_at": "2026-05-01T00:00:00Z"
  }
}
```

### 2.4 `GET /v1/monitors` (cursor list)
**Query:** `?status=active|broken|unused|duplicate|unknown&limit=1..200&cursor=opaque`
**Response 200 `data`:**
```json
[
  {
    "id": "ulid",
    "name": "trainer_stale_monitor",
    "owner": "trainer_atlas",
    "script_path": "tools/monitors/trainer_stale.py",
    "status": "active",
    "classification": "active",
    "last_run_at": "2026-05-24T11:59:00Z",
    "last_success_at": "2026-05-24T11:59:00Z",
    "last_failure_at": null,
    "metrics_emitted": ["trainer_stale_seconds"],
    "redis_keys_watched": ["v2:trainer:heartbeat"],
    "logs_watched": ["v2/logs/trainer/*.log"],
    "processes_watched": ["trainer_runtime"],
    "alerts_generated_24h": 0,
    "evidence": {"audit_ledger_id": "01HXY..."}
  }
]
```

### 2.5 `POST /v1/monitors/{id}/run`
**Headers:** `X-Idempotency-Key` required.
**Request:** `{"reason": "string (10..500)", "args?": {"k": "v"}}`
**Response 202:**
```json
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {"run_id": "ulid", "status": "queued", "queued_at": "..."}
}
```
**Errors:** `409 IDEM_KEY_REUSED_DIFFERENT_BODY`, `423 MONITOR_DISABLED`, `424 EVID_SCRIPT_NOT_REGISTERED`.

