{"type":"unsubscribe","topics":["risk_decisions"]}
{"type":"ping","ts":"..."}
```
**Server → Client:**
```json
{"type":"event","topic":"incidents","payload":{...}}
{"type":"pong","ts":"..."}
{"type":"error","code":"AUTH_EXPIRED","message":"..."}
```

