## 6. Risk-Gating Contract (binding for all action endpoints)

Any endpoint that proposes an action (paper order, strategy enable, kill-switch toggle, leverage change, etc.) MUST:

1. Build a `RiskProposal` (schema below) from validated input.
2. POST it to the in-process Risk Gateway (not over HTTP, not over Redis).
3. Receive a `RiskDecision`.
4. If `decision == "allow"`, hand `(proposal, decision)` to the Execution Engine (or paper adapter), capture `ExecutionResult`, audit `(proposal, decision, result)`, return success envelope.
5. If `decision == "deny"`, audit `(proposal, decision)`, return error envelope with `code = RISK_BLOCKED`, `details.gateway_decision = decision`.
6. Never bypass. Never override. Never re-shape the decision before returning it.

```jsonc
// RiskProposal
{
  "proposal_id": "prop_01HXYZ...",        // ULID
  "actor": { "user_id": "...", "role": "operator" },
  "intent": "paper_order|enable_strategy|toggle_killswitch|...",
  "symbol": "BTCUSDT|null",
  "side": "buy|sell|null",
  "quantity": "decimal-string|null",
  "leverage": "int|null",
  "margin_mode": "ISOLATED|CROSS|null",
  "config_version_id": "cfg_...",
  "feature_snapshot_id": "feat_...|null",
  "prediction_id": "pred_...|null",
  "requested_at": "2026-05-24T18:42:11.913Z"
}

// RiskDecision
{
  "decision": "allow|deny",
  "reason_code": "OK|MAX_POSITION|DAILY_LOSS|KILLSWITCH_ARMED|...",
  "reason_human": "string",
  "evaluated_rules": [
    { "rule_id": "...", "result": "pass|fail|skip", "evidence_ref": "..." }
  ],
  "decided_at": "2026-05-24T18:42:11.917Z",
  "audit_ledger_id": "aud_01HXYZ..."
}
```

