### 8.1 "Partial live-blocked" for config namespaces

`PUT /v2/admin/config/{namespace}` is paper-safe for most namespaces but **returns `LIVE_BLOCKED`** when `namespace` is one of:
`risk.live`, `exchange.api_keys`, `execution.live`, `leverage.live`, `kill_switch.live_override`, `margin_mode.live`. These can only change via the approval ceremony (W21-class), never via a direct config upsert.

